summary:
  The settings merge pairs a row with the popup's row at its address even
  when that row moved there in this write.

history:
  The same station saved twice, and the heal moved the first onto the
  second's address: the two were paired crosswise, and a twin removed on the
  page took the healed station's place.

target:
  package/contents/ui/ReorderLogic.js

find:
      pass(function(b, x) { return x.hostname === b.hostname && _blank(x.prev) === _blank(b.prev) })

replace:
      pass(function(b, x) { return x.hostname === b.hostname })

expect:
  Killed by tst_reorderlogic::test_merge_tells_a_healed_twin_from_the_one_it_landed_on.
  Line-neutral.
